flowchart TB
  subgraph WRITE[Writing an article]
    direction LR
    A1[A review report<br/>raises Q02] --> A2[You answer it]
  end
  subgraph PROPOSE[From answer to rule]
    direction LR
    B1[An agent calls<br/>propose_decision] --> B2[A pending candidate<br/>not yet a rule]
    B2 --> B3[You adopt it<br/>in the editor]
  end
  subgraph REUSE[Next article]
    direction LR
    C1[Ledger holds<br/>D-...md] --> C2[get_context puts it<br/>in the next brief]
    C2 --> C3[The draft starts<br/>with the rule]
  end
  WRITE --> PROPOSE
  PROPOSE --> REUSE
  C3 -->|the same finding comes back| D1[bragi recurrence counts<br/>articles it appears in]
  D1 -.->|the reason is gone| D2[You retire it<br/>never handed out again]
  classDef hot stroke:#c8401e,stroke-width:2px
  class B3,C2 hot
